WEBVTT

00:08.640 --> 00:10.270
What a wonderful aroma.

00:10.270 --> 00:11.800
The tea is Earl Grey.

00:14.510 --> 00:15.980
The pouring is perfect, as well.

00:20.120 --> 00:22.980
The black tea that Vier prepares is always delicious.

00:24.020 --> 00:25.210
Thank you.

00:27.790 --> 00:30.090
I wanted to talk with you.

00:31.030 --> 00:32.590
I'm sure the feeling is mutual.

02:07.490 --> 02:11.130
The Deceitful Heart

02:07.890 --> 02:09.620
Isn't it funny?

02:10.590 --> 02:13.860
To think enemies would be sharing tea like this.

02:14.330 --> 02:17.100
It was fate that we came into this world as enemies.

02:17.100 --> 02:20.340
However, fate is like a river that at times takes us to

02:20.340 --> 02:23.700
places we never thought we'd find ourselves.

02:25.010 --> 02:26.410
Aria.

02:26.410 --> 02:30.070
Where there are a hundred people, there are a hundred ways to be.

02:32.480 --> 02:34.070
You've changed.

02:34.650 --> 02:35.950
Haven't you been told so?

02:36.820 --> 02:39.150
I'll return those words.

02:39.150 --> 02:41.990
Aria, you've changed quite a bit, as well.

02:42.490 --> 02:44.250
Of course, in a good way.

02:47.160 --> 02:48.630
Is that right?

02:48.630 --> 02:51.620
It feels good to hear someone speak so frankly.

02:52.370 --> 02:56.400
All the more now with these idiotic battles continuing.

02:58.170 --> 03:02.910
Why do people betray?

03:07.820 --> 03:09.940
I wonder what everyone is doing.

03:10.690 --> 03:12.950
And Takuma, too...

03:15.690 --> 03:17.160
I'm fine.

03:17.730 --> 03:23.670
But I don't know what to do to fully awaken as the Tamayori princess.

03:31.540 --> 03:32.940
<i>It is fine now.</i>

03:33.580 --> 03:37.780
<i>But soon Takuma will lose his humanity,</i>

03:37.780 --> 03:40.870
<i>and will bare his fangs to the Tamayori princess.</i>

03:41.380 --> 03:44.480
<i>Eventually he will catch Tamaki and attempt to kill her.</i>

03:45.190 --> 03:46.950
Damn it!

03:48.560 --> 03:51.030
I-I'll never let that...

03:52.560 --> 03:55.200
Everyone desires the Artifact.

03:55.200 --> 03:59.290
That just shows how much power the Artifact has.

04:00.340 --> 04:03.970
If you were to make that power your own,

04:03.970 --> 04:08.580
your desires would be fulfilled far more easily than by betraying your friends.

04:08.580 --> 04:12.070
I do not desire power.

04:13.510 --> 04:15.480
You're the same as me.

04:18.120 --> 04:20.460
Everyone finds it strange.

04:20.460 --> 04:25.690
I find it much more strange that everyone desires power beyond their means.

04:27.530 --> 04:29.360
By the way, what is your name?

04:29.360 --> 04:31.330
I am Suguru Ohmi.

04:32.030 --> 04:34.300
Then he who is called Suguru,

04:34.300 --> 04:36.360
I have something I'd like to ask you.

04:36.870 --> 04:37.930
Yes.

04:38.610 --> 04:43.980
With the power of the Artifact, is it possible to revive the dead?

04:47.720 --> 04:50.240
No one knows the truth.

04:52.290 --> 04:54.720
Even if it were possible,

04:54.720 --> 04:58.090
I believe it would be unforgivable.

05:00.460 --> 05:01.620
I see.

05:04.830 --> 05:06.730
You appear tired.

05:07.140 --> 05:09.100
Please rest.

05:09.600 --> 05:10.660
Yes.

05:11.910 --> 05:13.240
That song...

05:14.680 --> 05:15.580
Yes.

05:17.950 --> 05:26.580
Close your eyes, quietly, quietly

05:26.850 --> 05:34.960
Tonight will bring a fleeting dream

05:35.760 --> 05:44.100
Tears like pearls fall secretly, secretly

05:44.540 --> 05:53.070
Please give them to me

05:53.780 --> 06:03.780
Soft as a feather, I'll soothe your pain

06:15.970 --> 06:19.370
You remind me of my mother.

06:20.480 --> 06:23.040
I almost can't believe you're someone else.

06:29.820 --> 06:33.050
You're welcome to guard
Aria as Drei instructed,

06:33.050 --> 06:36.190
but if you do anything to hurt her,

06:36.190 --> 06:37.920
don't think I'll overlook it.

06:51.670 --> 06:53.040
Mitsuru.

06:53.040 --> 06:53.910
Yes?

06:55.010 --> 06:58.140
Is Tamaki behaving herself in her room?

06:58.610 --> 06:59.550
Yes.

06:59.550 --> 07:00.620
I see.

07:00.620 --> 07:02.680
Then take this opportunity...

07:03.020 --> 07:05.210
to prepare for the ceremony.

07:06.390 --> 07:07.860
B-But...

07:08.390 --> 07:09.550
Yes?

07:10.020 --> 07:14.960
There's still a chance that Tamaki could fully awaken as the Tamayori princess...

07:14.960 --> 07:18.090
We don't know whether she can do it or not.

07:21.340 --> 07:23.440
What's wrong?

07:23.440 --> 07:26.500
We cannot undo it now, Mitsuru.

07:27.640 --> 07:33.170
How many people have we killed already?

07:33.650 --> 07:35.740
All for the sake of the Onikirimaru.

07:37.620 --> 07:38.750
Go in.

07:47.830 --> 07:50.560
The ceremonial offering must not be delayed.

08:01.610 --> 08:04.350
Prepare for the ceremonial offering.

08:04.350 --> 08:06.250
All right, Mitsuru?

08:06.250 --> 08:09.220
Until then, I'll continue to strengthen the barrier.

08:09.520 --> 08:13.220
Tamaki mustn't take a single step from her room.

08:26.700 --> 08:29.300
No. This is no time to be depressed.

08:33.610 --> 08:37.640
<i>In any case, I must become a complete Tamayori princess quickly.</i>

08:38.050 --> 08:39.810
<i>Wait for me, Takuma.</i>

08:52.560 --> 08:53.960
Tamaki...

08:56.230 --> 08:57.130
Damn it!

08:58.330 --> 08:59.490
Mahiro.

09:00.030 --> 09:01.630
I know.

09:01.970 --> 09:05.640
But Lady Baba won't let us see Tamaki,

09:05.640 --> 09:10.010
and then she suddenly calls us together and tells us to guard the shrine.

09:10.440 --> 09:13.350
What is she thinking?!
Don't you feel the same?

09:13.950 --> 09:17.390
Yes. There are many things
I don't understand.

09:17.890 --> 09:21.340
There's an even stronger barrier being formed around us.

09:22.090 --> 09:26.150
I don't see any need to increase our defenses this much, but...

09:28.160 --> 09:29.900
Shinji, what's wrong?

09:29.900 --> 09:32.060
I-It's nothing.

09:32.700 --> 09:36.330
There's no need to worry about him, is there?

09:37.240 --> 09:38.770
Mahiro, stop it.

09:38.770 --> 09:40.640
We're friends.

09:40.640 --> 09:41.540
But-

09:51.190 --> 09:52.450
Mitsuru?

10:00.730 --> 10:01.860
What's wrong?

10:02.860 --> 10:04.420
Mitsuru?

10:06.930 --> 10:08.230
Mitsuru!

10:29.960 --> 10:30.930
I've had enough!

10:42.400 --> 10:43.840
What do you think you're doing, Shinji?!

10:48.510 --> 10:49.410
Are you all right?

10:52.280 --> 10:53.780
Shinji, calm down.

10:53.780 --> 10:55.110
I've had enough!

10:55.650 --> 10:57.310
I'm taking that to Logos!

10:57.920 --> 11:00.590
With the Onikirimaru gone from this village,

11:00.590 --> 11:03.860
we can finally put an end to all of this!

11:03.860 --> 11:04.760
Shinji!

11:04.760 --> 11:06.130
Let go of me!

11:07.260 --> 11:08.360
Wait, Mahiro.

11:08.360 --> 11:09.490
Are you kidding me?!

11:11.930 --> 11:14.040
Have you thought about how much

11:14.040 --> 11:17.710
you've hurt everyone with your selfish ideas?

11:17.710 --> 11:19.340
I know.

11:19.340 --> 11:20.330
No, you don't!

11:21.140 --> 11:23.480
If you did, you couldn't say something like that!

11:23.480 --> 11:25.840
That was the only choice I had!

11:28.980 --> 11:32.110
I'm actually a Kotokura...

11:34.860 --> 11:37.120
I was adopted into the Inukai family.

11:38.260 --> 11:42.460
But I didn't have any power, so I was thrown away.

11:43.300 --> 11:46.200
I didn't want to betray anyone.

11:46.200 --> 11:48.530
I wanted to stay friends with everyone.

11:49.240 --> 11:51.670
But what else...

11:52.410 --> 11:54.770
What else could I have done?!

12:02.780 --> 12:04.810
That's enough, Shinji.

12:06.350 --> 12:09.820
What we need to do now isn't look back at the past,

12:09.820 --> 12:14.390
but to make the future better, no matter how little.

12:16.660 --> 12:20.360
Let's try to think about what we can do now.

12:21.500 --> 12:22.970
We're friends.

12:23.940 --> 12:24.930
And...

12:26.370 --> 12:29.640
we probably don't have much time left.

12:40.420 --> 12:42.690
Sorry for hitting you.

12:44.960 --> 12:46.150
No.

12:47.130 --> 12:50.260
I've done something I can't take back.

12:51.070 --> 12:51.930
Forget it.

12:51.930 --> 12:55.370
No, I know I can never redeem myself.

12:55.370 --> 12:56.800
I told you...

12:56.800 --> 12:59.140
It's all my fault.

12:59.140 --> 13:00.940
I said, it's fine!

13:01.310 --> 13:02.940
I'll hit you again!

13:07.880 --> 13:09.210
Never mind.

13:09.780 --> 13:13.050
This is stupid. Being mad is making me hungry.

13:13.050 --> 13:18.960
I know, Shinji. You make dinner tonight and we'll call it even.

13:18.960 --> 13:21.720
However, if it isn't good,
I won't be so sure.

13:24.770 --> 13:25.700
Yes.

13:31.670 --> 13:33.900
Shinji, I'll clean your wounds.

13:36.580 --> 13:37.700
Yes.

13:43.320 --> 13:46.350
<i>You're still small,</i>

13:46.350 --> 13:49.160
<i>but as you have inherited the role of a guardian,</i>

13:49.160 --> 13:51.960
<i>I will explain to you, as yet an unknown,</i>

13:51.960 --> 13:56.190
<i>the role that you and the
Atori house alone possess.</i>

14:00.600 --> 14:01.970
It's time.

14:03.140 --> 14:03.900
Senpai!

14:10.210 --> 14:11.470
Takuma, you-

14:12.310 --> 14:13.470
Look.

14:15.050 --> 14:17.550
The idea that I would become a demon because of Tamaki,

14:17.550 --> 14:20.450
and that as a demon I would kill Tamaki, isn't possible!

14:23.190 --> 14:25.060
So let me meet with Tamaki!

14:26.790 --> 14:29.260
I want to see Tamaki!

14:31.330 --> 14:32.200
Takuma.

14:38.740 --> 14:41.310
<i>When the heaven and the earth were first divided,</i>

14:41.310 --> 14:44.080
<i>the first god that came into being in the Plain of Heaven</i>

14:44.080 --> 14:46.270
<i>was named Amenominakanushi.</i>

14:47.210 --> 14:50.890
<i>When Amenominakanushi disappeared,</i>

14:50.890 --> 14:53.750
<i>he turned half of himself into a blade,</i>

14:53.750 --> 14:55.620
<i>and threw that blade to the earth.</i>

14:56.290 --> 15:00.030
<i>If used by one who was evil, it would destroy all things.</i>

15:00.030 --> 15:04.360
<i>If used by one who was good, it would purify all living things.</i>

15:05.600 --> 15:08.400
<i>And so it was released.</i>

15:13.270 --> 15:14.710
I'm sorry...

15:15.440 --> 15:17.040
I'm sorry...

15:18.280 --> 15:19.870
It's been sealed?

15:20.380 --> 15:22.010
I'm sorry...

15:25.220 --> 15:27.050
Who are you?

15:28.090 --> 15:36.290
How can I apologize...?

15:37.430 --> 15:38.690
I'm sorry...

15:39.570 --> 15:40.900
I'm sorry...

15:42.600 --> 15:44.870
<i>What a sad voice.</i>

15:46.670 --> 15:49.230
Where are you?

15:49.780 --> 15:51.610
What should I do?

15:52.410 --> 15:53.400
You mustn't.

15:56.620 --> 15:58.880
Do not blame yourself.

15:59.790 --> 16:02.720
<i>This is the person I saw in my dream.</i>

16:05.130 --> 16:06.420
I'm sorry.

16:06.960 --> 16:09.620
I was caught up in revenge.

16:10.100 --> 16:14.090
Why did I allow that sword to be released?

16:16.640 --> 16:18.870
That was something I did.

16:19.270 --> 16:22.110
I wanted to fulfill your wish.

16:23.810 --> 16:27.250
You are suffering from your sadness.

16:27.850 --> 16:29.440
Just like I am.

16:34.150 --> 16:36.750
May your sins be forgiven.

16:37.620 --> 16:39.960
May peace come someday.

16:42.660 --> 16:46.330
I do not care what happens to me.

16:47.600 --> 16:48.630
I...

16:56.040 --> 16:57.240
You're...

16:59.450 --> 17:00.410
Tamaki!

17:03.720 --> 17:05.480
Tamaki, Tamaki!

17:07.450 --> 17:08.820
Tamaki!

17:09.460 --> 17:11.080
Takuma, stop!

17:14.830 --> 17:16.000
Takuma?

17:16.000 --> 17:17.970
What is this ruckus?

17:19.600 --> 17:24.000
I believe I was quite clear when I told you not to approach this place.

17:24.000 --> 17:26.010
To allow an intruder in...

17:26.010 --> 17:28.170
What do you think you have been guarding?

17:28.710 --> 17:31.800
Lady Baba, what is the meaning of this?

17:32.880 --> 17:34.210
Of what?

17:34.210 --> 17:37.750
What need is there to strengthen the barrier this much?

17:37.750 --> 17:40.420
And what need is there to place

17:40.420 --> 17:43.320
a powerful barrier right outside Tamaki's room?!

17:43.790 --> 17:46.360
More than just protecting her,

17:46.360 --> 17:48.190
it's like you're trapping her inside!

17:51.370 --> 17:53.930
Tamaki! I won't become a demon.

17:55.270 --> 17:59.070
Even if I do, I definitely won't kill you.

17:59.870 --> 18:01.810
What about you, Tamaki?

18:02.280 --> 18:04.580
Are you that scared of me?

18:04.580 --> 18:05.980
Don't you believe me?!

18:07.280 --> 18:10.310
<i>I'm not scared. I'm not at all scared, Takuma!</i>

18:11.290 --> 18:14.410
<i>There's no way you'll become a monster.</i>

18:15.560 --> 18:16.750
<i>But...</i>

18:17.930 --> 18:21.190
<i>But, right now I can't, Takuma.</i>

18:24.630 --> 18:26.220
In the middle of something?

18:28.440 --> 18:31.030
You've come at a good time.

18:31.510 --> 18:34.370
Can you please detain that insolent one?

18:34.710 --> 18:35.940
All of you, too.

18:35.940 --> 18:40.450
What are you staring at? Get moving.

18:40.450 --> 18:43.350
Tamaki, answer me. Tamaki!

18:43.350 --> 18:44.220
Takuma.

18:44.220 --> 18:45.590
You can't do any more than this.

18:45.590 --> 18:46.550
Senpai.

18:46.550 --> 18:47.990
Tamaki!

18:47.990 --> 18:49.220
Silence!

18:50.460 --> 18:52.530
You are the child of a demon.

18:52.530 --> 18:54.930
You carry monstrous blood.

18:54.930 --> 18:56.950
You are only a danger to Tamaki.

18:57.970 --> 19:01.130
You are unnecessary to Tamaki.

19:01.470 --> 19:03.100
Do you not understand that?

19:07.070 --> 19:09.680
Tamaki has accepted that,

19:09.680 --> 19:12.150
so she doesn't attempt to leave her room.

19:13.110 --> 19:14.980
Or will you only be satisfied

19:14.980 --> 19:19.980
if Tamaki tells you, "You scare me.
I don't want to see you again"?

19:24.590 --> 19:26.720
Tamaki, is that right?

19:27.490 --> 19:29.120
Is that what you think?

19:31.570 --> 19:33.970
<i>No. No, I don't.</i>

19:33.970 --> 19:36.060
<i>I really want to be by your side.</i>

19:37.000 --> 19:38.110
<i>But...</i>

19:38.110 --> 19:43.480
<i>Tamaki, you're attempting to awaken the demon inside of Takuma.</i>

19:44.610 --> 19:48.380
I can't. As I am right now, I just...

19:50.080 --> 19:52.810
Go home! Go home, Takuma!

19:53.490 --> 19:56.220
Don't come to me anymore.

19:59.460 --> 20:00.980
Please go home.

20:04.030 --> 20:05.700
Takuma Onizaki.

20:05.700 --> 20:08.860
I release you from your duty as a guardian.

20:09.200 --> 20:12.070
You must not show your face here again.

20:13.740 --> 20:15.800
Can you stand? Let me help you.

20:18.210 --> 20:21.380
I guess you don't need me.

20:25.650 --> 20:27.920
Hey, Takuma! Wait!

20:27.920 --> 20:29.580
Leave him.

20:30.320 --> 20:32.880
You will continue to stand guard.

20:33.430 --> 20:34.990
This way.

20:46.770 --> 20:48.000
<i>Takuma...</i>

20:48.680 --> 20:50.140
<i>It's a lie.</i>

20:50.140 --> 20:52.200
<i>I lied when I told you to leave.</i>

20:52.350 --> 20:54.910
<i>There's no way that's how I feel.</i>

20:55.450 --> 20:59.350
<i>The truth is, I want you with me.</i>

21:00.290 --> 21:03.020
<i>But I'm no good as I am now.</i>

21:04.060 --> 21:05.390
<i>But...</i>

21:08.960 --> 21:10.930
<i>If that's true...</i>

23:11.790 --> 23:14.380
Please, open!

23:22.830 --> 23:24.700
<i>Wait for me, Takuma.</i>

23:25.270 --> 23:28.000
<i>I won't let you become a demon.</i>

23:38.380 --> 23:40.680
I'll always protect you.

23:43.020 --> 23:47.480
I'll blow away anything that threatens you.

23:50.920 --> 23:54.360
So just relax and smile.

23:55.060 --> 24:00.930
Next Time: Memory of a Dream
